       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SUSEROPT.
       AUTHOR.         ANNETTE M. KRAUSS/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
       INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   JUNE 6, 1987.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS.
      *D* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *D*                                                         *
      *D*  SUSEROPT    USER OPTIONS SUBPROGRAM                    *
      *D*                                                         *
      *D* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *
      *C*  CHANGES
      *C*  OCT 92    CR KALMAN   REQ: 6268
      *C*  NEEDED TO ADD A SWITCH FOR PLANTS TO DECIDE IF THEY NEED
      *C*  TO DISCOUNT ACCRUED TAXES OR NOT. ADDED THE QUESTION TO
      *C*  USEROPT3 SCREEN. BECAUSE THIS SCREEN WAS SO FILLED I HAD
      *C*  TO REMOVE SOME SPACE LINES AND CHANGE THE APPEARANCE OF
      *C*  THE SCREEN FOR LEGIBILITY.
      *C*
      *C*  OCT 92    CR KALMAN
      *C*  WHILE MAKING THE ABOVE CHANGES I FOUND THAT THE MATCONT SW
      *C*  WAS NOT GETTING A DEFAULT VALUE AND THAT THERE WAS A LOCKING
      *C*  PROBLEM ON USEROPT1.  BOTH THESE PROBLEMS WERE FIXED.
      *C*
      *C*  OCT 92    CR KALMAN
      *C*  ADDED A SWITCH TO CONTROL THE NUMBER OF ABSTFILES THAT TINVGEN
      *C*  PROCESSES FOR AUTOMATIC INVOICE GENERATION.
      *C*
      *C*
      *C*  JAN 19, 1993   CR KALMAN      REQ: 6347
      *C*  FIXED CODE TO MAKE SURE TAX DISCOUNT SWITCH DEFAULTS TO
      *C*  "NO".
      *C*
      *C*  MAY 5, 1993    JE COFFMAN     REQ: 6401
      *C*  ADDED A SWITCH FOR THE USER TO DESIGNATE WHETHER PURCHASE ORDER
      *C*  INFORMATION SHOULD BE DELETED IF A NEW WORK ORDER NUMBER IS STILL
      *C*  ACTIVE IN MVALIDPLTDATA.
      *C*
      *C*  AUG 23, 1994   JE COFFMAN     REQ: 6527
      *C*  ADDED A SWITCH FOR THE USER TO DESIGNATE WHETHER CHAT REFERENCE
      *C*  NUMBERS SHOULD BE INCLUDED ON CSIS DOCUMENTS CONTAINING CORPORATE
      *C*  CODED ITEMS.
      *C*
      *C*  OCT 07, 1994   WL MCINTYRE    REQ: 94-027
      *C*  ADDED A SWITCH FOR THE USER TO DESIGNATE WHETHER UNIT AND DOLLAR
      *C*  VALUE CHECKS SHOULD BE USED ON STOREROOM RETURNS AND IF SO, TO
      *C*  SPECIFY WHAT THE UNIT AND VALUE LIMITS SHOULD BE.
      *C*
      *C*  FEB 27, 1995   WL MCINTYRE    REQ: 94-027
      *C*  ADDED CODE TO ACCOMODATE CHANGE TO MPLTINFO FIELDS THAT
      *C*  ALLOWS USER TO SEPARATELY SPECIFY THE USE OF LIMITS FOR
      *C*  UNIT AND MONETARY VALUES.
      *C*
      *C*  JAN 23, 1996   CA YODER       REQ: 95-039
      *C*  ADDED FIELD TO KEEP TRACK OF HOW MANY MONTHS TO KEEP
      *C*  SHIPPING RELEASE AUDIT DATA.  FIELD ADDED TO KEY "PODL".
      *C*

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                   ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZPLTSTUP-SI
                   ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                   ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                   FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                   CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
            SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                   ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                   RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                   PIC X(2000).
       FD  MPLTINFO-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X VALUE SPACE.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **           P R O G R A M   V A R I A B L E S             **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       77  LINE-NO                       PIC 9(2)  VALUE 1.

       01  REPLACE-SW                    PIC X(1).
           88  REPLACE-SW-ON          VALUE "Y".

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **              D A T A    B A S E    A R E A              **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       COPY MPLTINFO IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTST   IN COPYLIB.
       01  MPLTINFO-ARG                  PIC X(4).
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **              V I E W   W O R K   A R E A                **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT                  PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD                   PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD
                                         PIC Z(11)9.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **                 TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                  **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       01  USER-OPTION-SCREEN.
           05  PHYS-INV-SW               PIC X(1).
           05  DATE-WANT-SW              PIC X(1).
           05  REM-WS-PW                 PIC X(1).
           05  VALID-EMPL-CRAFTWS        PIC X(1).
           05  VALID-EMPL-STORES         PIC X(1).
           05  AVG-COST-SW               PIC X(1).
           05  ALLOW-RETURN-VALUE-SW     PIC X(1).
           05  DEPT-EXP-REQ-SW           PIC X(1).
           05  ACCT-DATA-SW              PIC X(1).
           05  S1-CMDLINE                PIC X(79).
           05  S1-MSGLINE                PIC X(79).

       01  USER-OPTION-SCREEN2.
           05  COMP-PRIME-REQ-SW         PIC X(1).
           05  COMP-PRIME-PO-SW          PIC X(1).
           05  TC326-SW                  PIC X(1).
           05  MP1-OVERRD-CHG-DEPT       PIC X(1).
           05  WO-OVERRD-ENTRY           PIC X(1).
           05  WO-OVERRD-EXP             PIC X(1).
           05  ENTRY-OVERRD-EXP          PIC X(1).
           05  CHAT-PURCH-REQUIRED-SW    PIC X(1).
           05  CHAT-RCVG-REQUIRED-SW     PIC X(1).
           05  INV-PREPAY-SW             PIC X(1).
           05  S2-CMDLINE                PIC X(79).
           05  S2-MSGLINE                PIC X(79).

       01  USER-OPTION-SCREEN2A.
           05  RETURN-UNIT-YORN          PIC X(1).
           05  RETURN-UNIT-LIMIT         PIC 9(4).
           05  RETURN-VALUE-YORN         PIC X(1).
           05  RETURN-VALUE-LIMIT        PIC 9(8).
           05  S2A-CMDLINE               PIC X(79).
           05  S2A-MSGLINE               PIC X(79).

       01  USER-OPTION-SCREEN3.
           05  BUYER-REDISPLAY-SW        PIC X(1).
           05  SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW         PIC X(1).
           05  CUR-CODE-REQUIRED-SW      PIC X(1).
           05  MATCONT-COMP-PO-SW        PIC X(1).
           05  PO-COMPARE-PRICE-SW       PIC X(1).
           05  PO-COMPARE-PERCENT        PIC 9V99.
           05  REQ-PRINT-MANUF-SW        PIC X(1).
           05  ADDTL-DATA-SW             PIC X(1).
           05  S3-CMDLINE                PIC X(79).
           05  S3-MSGLINE                PIC X(79).

       01  USER-OPTION-SCREEN4.
9210CK     05  DISCOUNT-TAX-SW           PIC X(1).
9210CK     05  LAST-ABST                 PIC 9.
9305JC     05  ACTIVE-NWO-SW             PIC X.
           05  NUM-MONTHS                PIC 9(2).
           05  S4-CMDLINE                PIC X(79).
           05  S4-MSGLINE                PIC X(79).

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **         S U B P R O G R A M   A R E A S                 **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       COPY TBLOWUP  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDATA IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **               LINKAGE   SECTION                         **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  BASE                          PIC X(10).
       COPY VCOMLINK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGSUB IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE,
                                VIEW-COMAREA,
                                LANGUAGE-PARMS.


       1-START.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O.
           PERFORM 60-SCREEN1  THRU 60-SCREEN1-X.
           PERFORM 61-SCREEN2  THRU 61-SCREEN2-X.
           PERFORM 62-SCREEN2A THRU 62-SCREEN2A-X.
           PERFORM 63-SCREEN3  THRU 63-SCREEN3-X.
           PERFORM 64-SCREEN4  THRU 64-SCREEN4-X.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O.
           GOBACK.

      ******************************************************
      **                 BLOWUP ROUTINE                   **
      ******************************************************
       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *         M A I N    P R O C E S S I N G         *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************

       60-SCREEN1.
           MOVE "SUSEROPT"             TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
           MOVE "USEROPT1"             TO  VIEW-NFNAME.

       60-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO  USER-OPTION-SCREEN.
           PERFORM 601-READ-MPLTINFO.

       60-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE USER-OPTION-SCREEN     TO  DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC            TO  USER-OPTION-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 60-SCREEN1-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9                TO  LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10                TO  LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER     TO  S1-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"               TO  IND(99)
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

       60-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "PIPT"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE PHYS-INV-SW            TO  MPLTINFO-PHYS-INV-SW.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           MOVE "PREQ"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE DATE-WANT-SW           TO  MPLTINFO-DATE-WANT-SW.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           MOVE "STST"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE REM-WS-PW              TO  MPLT-WS-PW-SW.
           MOVE VALID-EMPL-CRAFTWS     TO  MPLT-VALID-EMPL-CRAFTWS.
           MOVE VALID-EMPL-STORES      TO  MPLT-VALID-EMPL-STORES.
           MOVE ALLOW-RETURN-VALUE-SW  TO  MPLT-ALLOW-RETURN-VALUE.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           MOVE "PAVG" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF AVG-COST-SW = "N"
              IF FILE-STATUS  = "00"
                 DELETE MPLTINFO-O
                    INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                 END-DELETE
                 IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                    MOVE "DELETE MPLTINFO*60-RM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG   TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
           IF AVG-COST-SW = "Y"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                 MOVE SPACES TO BUF-MPLTINFO
                 MOVE "PAVG" TO MPLTINFO-KEY
                 WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                    INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                 END-WRITE
                 IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                    MOVE "WRITE MPLTINFO*60-RM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE MPLTINFO-KEY   TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE "PDER"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE DEPT-EXP-REQ-SW        TO  MPLTINFO-PDER-SW.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           MOVE "PACD"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE ACCT-DATA-SW           TO  MPLTINFO-PACD-SW.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

       60-SCREEN1-X.
           EXIT.

       601-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "PIPT"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "PIPT"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLTINFO-PHYS-INV-SW,
                                           PHYS-INV-SW
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLTINFO-PHYS-INV-SW   TO  PHYS-INV-SW.

           MOVE "PREQ"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "PREQ"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "000100"           TO  MPLTINFO-REQ-NO
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLTINFO-DATE-WANT-SW
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO.

      *------------  MPLTINFO-DATE-WANT-SW ADDED TO 'PREQ' FOR B 0300
      *------------  CSIS/MMIS RELEASE.   THE FOLLOWING WILL ENSURE THAT
      *------------  THE DEFAULT APPEARS ON THE SCREEN AND KEY IS UPDATED
      *------------  IF NOT ALREADY IN DATABASE.
           IF MPLTINFO-DATE-WANT-SW = "Y" OR "N"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-DATE-WANT-SW TO DATE-WANT-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "N"                TO  DATE-WANT-SW,
                                             MPLTINFO-DATE-WANT-SW
               PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           MOVE "STST"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "STST"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "00"               TO  MPLTINFO-STR-PRT
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLT-ALWAYS-MULT-STR-CODE
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLT-MULT-STR-FLAG
               MOVE "Y"                TO  MPLT-WO-OVERRD-ENTRY
               MOVE "Y"                TO  MPLT-WO-OVERRD-EXP
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLT-ENTRY-OVERRD-EXP
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLT-WS-PW-SW,
                                           REM-WS-PW
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLT-VALID-EMPL-CRAFTWS,
                                           VALID-EMPL-CRAFTWS
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLT-VALID-EMPL-STORES,
                                           VALID-EMPL-STORES
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLT-MP1-OVERRD-CHG-DEPT
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLT-WS-PW-SW            TO  REM-WS-PW
           MOVE MPLT-VALID-EMPL-CRAFTWS  TO  VALID-EMPL-CRAFTWS
           MOVE MPLT-VALID-EMPL-STORES   TO  VALID-EMPL-STORES.
           MOVE MPLT-ALLOW-RETURN-VALUE  TO  ALLOW-RETURN-VALUE-SW.

           MOVE "PAVG"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE "N"                TO  AVG-COST-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "Y"                TO  AVG-COST-SW.

           MOVE "PDER"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "PDER"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "Y"                TO  MPLTINFO-PDER-SW
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLTINFO-PDER-SW       TO  DEPT-EXP-REQ-SW.

           MOVE "PACD"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "PACD"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "Y"                TO  MPLTINFO-PACD-SW
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLTINFO-PACD-SW       TO  ACCT-DATA-SW.

9210CK*------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
  .        MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
  .        START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
9210CK         INVALID KEY MOVE "00"     TO  FILE-STATUS.

       61-SCREEN2.
           MOVE "USEROPT2"             TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO  USER-OPTION-SCREEN2.
           PERFORM 611-READ-MPLTINFO.

       61-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE USER-OPTION-SCREEN2    TO  DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC            TO  USER-OPTION-SCREEN2.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 61-SCREEN2-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9                TO  LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10                TO  LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER     TO  S2-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"               TO  IND(99)
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

       61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "PCPR"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE COMP-PRIME-REQ-SW      TO  MPLTINFO-PCPR-SW.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           MOVE "PCPO"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE COMP-PRIME-PO-SW       TO  MPLTINFO-PCPO-SW.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           MOVE "P326"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE TC326-SW               TO  MPLTINFO-P326-SW.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           MOVE "STST"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE MP1-OVERRD-CHG-DEPT    TO  MPLT-MP1-OVERRD-CHG-DEPT.
           MOVE WO-OVERRD-ENTRY        TO  MPLT-WO-OVERRD-ENTRY.
           MOVE WO-OVERRD-EXP          TO  MPLT-WO-OVERRD-EXP.
           MOVE ENTRY-OVERRD-EXP       TO  MPLT-ENTRY-OVERRD-EXP.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           MOVE "CHAT"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE CHAT-PURCH-REQUIRED-SW TO  MPLTINFO-CHAT-PURCH-REQUIRED.
           MOVE CHAT-RCVG-REQUIRED-SW  TO  MPLTINFO-CHAT-RCVG-REQUIRED.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

           MOVE "PINV"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE INV-PREPAY-SW          TO  MPLTINFO-INV-PREPAY-SW.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

       61-SCREEN2-X.
           EXIT.

       611-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "PCPR"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "PCPR"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLTINFO-PCPR-SW
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLTINFO-PCPR-SW       TO  COMP-PRIME-REQ-SW.

           MOVE "PCPO"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "PCPO"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLTINFO-PCPO-SW
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLTINFO-PCPO-SW       TO  COMP-PRIME-PO-SW.

           MOVE "P326"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "P326"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLTINFO-P326-SW
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLTINFO-P326-SW       TO  TC326-SW.

           MOVE "STST"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "STST"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLT-MP1-OVERRD-CHG-DEPT  TO  MP1-OVERRD-CHG-DEPT
               MOVE MPLT-WO-OVERRD-ENTRY      TO  WO-OVERRD-ENTRY
               MOVE MPLT-WO-OVERRD-EXP        TO  WO-OVERRD-EXP
               MOVE MPLT-ENTRY-OVERRD-EXP     TO  ENTRY-OVERRD-EXP.

           IF MP1-OVERRD-CHG-DEPT = SPACES
               MOVE "N" TO MP1-OVERRD-CHG-DEPT.

           MOVE "CHAT"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "CHAT"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLTINFO-CHAT-PURCH-REQUIRED
                                           CHAT-PURCH-REQUIRED-SW
               MOVE "Y"                TO  MPLTINFO-CHAT-RCVG-REQUIRED
                                           CHAT-RCVG-REQUIRED-SW
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLTINFO-CHAT-PURCH-REQUIRED TO  CHAT-PURCH-REQUIRED-SW
           MOVE MPLTINFO-CHAT-RCVG-REQUIRED  TO  CHAT-RCVG-REQUIRED-SW.

           MOVE "PINV"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "PINV"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "N"                TO  MPLTINFO-INV-PREPAY-SW,
                                           INV-PREPAY-SW
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO
           ELSE
           MOVE MPLTINFO-INV-PREPAY-SW TO  INV-PREPAY-SW.

      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00"   TO  FILE-STATUS.

       62-SCREEN2A.
           MOVE "USEROPT2A"             TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES                  TO  USER-OPTION-SCREEN2A.
           PERFORM 621-READ-MPLTINFO.

       62-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE USER-OPTION-SCREEN2A   TO  DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC            TO  USER-OPTION-SCREEN2A.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 62-SCREEN2A-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9                TO  LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10                TO  LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER     TO  S2A-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"               TO  IND(99)
               GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

       62-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "PLIM"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF RETURN-UNIT-YORN = "Y"
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
              MOVE ZEROS               TO  RETURN-UNIT-LIMIT
              MOVE "N"                 TO  RETURN-UNIT-YORN.
           IF RETURN-VALUE-YORN = "Y"
              NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
              MOVE ZEROS               TO  RETURN-VALUE-LIMIT
              MOVE "N"                 TO  RETURN-VALUE-YORN.
           MOVE RETURN-UNIT-YORN       TO  MPLTINFO-RETURN-UNIT-YORN.
           MOVE RETURN-UNIT-LIMIT      TO  MPLTINFO-RETURN-UNIT-LIMIT.
           MOVE RETURN-VALUE-YORN      TO  MPLTINFO-RETURN-VALUE-YORN.
           MOVE RETURN-VALUE-LIMIT     TO  MPLTINFO-RETURN-VALUE-LIMIT.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

       62-SCREEN2A-X.
           EXIT.

       621-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "PLIM"                TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
              MOVE SPACES             TO  BUF-MPLTINFO
              MOVE "PLIM"             TO  MPLTINFO-KEY
              MOVE "N"                TO  MPLTINFO-RETURN-UNIT-YORN
              MOVE "N"                TO  MPLTINFO-RETURN-VALUE-YORN
              MOVE ZEROS              TO  MPLTINFO-RETURN-UNIT-LIMIT
              MOVE ZEROS              TO  MPLTINFO-RETURN-VALUE-LIMIT
              PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-RETURN-UNIT-YORN   TO  RETURN-UNIT-YORN.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-RETURN-VALUE-YORN  TO  RETURN-VALUE-YORN.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-RETURN-UNIT-LIMIT  TO  RETURN-UNIT-LIMIT.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-RETURN-VALUE-LIMIT TO  RETURN-VALUE-LIMIT.

      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00"   TO  FILE-STATUS.

       63-SCREEN3.
           MOVE "USEROPT3"             TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO  USER-OPTION-SCREEN3.
           PERFORM 631-READ-MPLTINFO.

       63-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE USER-OPTION-SCREEN3    TO  DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC            TO  USER-OPTION-SCREEN3.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 63-SCREEN3-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9                TO  LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10                TO  LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER     TO  S2-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"               TO  IND(99)
               GO TO 63-SHOW-FORM.

       63-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "POPT"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE BUYER-REDISPLAY-SW     TO MPLTINFO-BUYER-REDISPLAY-SW.
           IF SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW = "R"
               MOVE "Y"                TO  MPLTINFO-SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "N"                TO MPLTINFO-SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW.
           MOVE CUR-CODE-REQUIRED-SW TO MPLTINFO-CUR-CODE-REQUIRED-SW.
           MOVE MATCONT-COMP-PO-SW     TO MPLTINFO-MATCONT-COMP-PO-SW.
           MOVE PO-COMPARE-PRICE-SW    TO MPLTINFO-PO-COMPARE-PRICE-SW.
           IF PO-COMPARE-PRICE-SW = "N"
               MOVE ZEROS              TO MPLTINFO-PO-COMPARE-PERCENT
           ELSE
               MOVE PO-COMPARE-PERCENT TO MPLTINFO-PO-COMPARE-PERCENT.
           MOVE REQ-PRINT-MANUF-SW     TO MPLTINFO-REQ-PRINT-MANUF-SW.
           MOVE ADDTL-DATA-SW          TO MPLTINFO-ADDTL-DATA-EDIT-SW.
           PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

       63-SCREEN3-X.
           EXIT.

       631-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "POPT"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
           PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES             TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "POPT"             TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "Y"                TO MPLTINFO-BUYER-REDISPLAY-SW
               MOVE "N"                TO MPLTINFO-SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW
               MOVE "N"                TO MPLTINFO-CUR-CODE-REQUIRED-SW
9210CK         MOVE "N"                TO MPLTINFO-MATCONT-COMP-PO-SW
               MOVE "N"                TO MPLTINFO-PO-COMPARE-PRICE-SW
               MOVE ZEROS              TO MPLTINFO-PO-COMPARE-PERCENT
               MOVE "N"                TO MPLTINFO-REQ-PRINT-MANUF-SW
               MOVE "Y"                TO MPLTINFO-ADDTL-DATA-EDIT-SW
               PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO.

           IF MPLTINFO-BUYER-REDISPLAY-SW = "N"
               MOVE "N"                TO  BUYER-REDISPLAY-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "Y"                TO  BUYER-REDISPLAY-SW.

           IF MPLTINFO-SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "R"                TO  SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "L"                TO  SW-VENDOR-ADDR-SW.

           IF MPLTINFO-CUR-CODE-REQUIRED-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "Y"                TO  CUR-CODE-REQUIRED-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "N"                TO  CUR-CODE-REQUIRED-SW.

           IF MPLTINFO-MATCONT-COMP-PO-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "Y"                TO  MATCONT-COMP-PO-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "N"                TO  MATCONT-COMP-PO-SW.

           IF MPLTINFO-PO-COMPARE-PRICE-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "Y"                TO  PO-COMPARE-PRICE-SW
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PO-COMPARE-PERCENT TO PO-COMPARE-PERCENT
           ELSE
               MOVE "N"                TO  PO-COMPARE-PRICE-SW
               MOVE ZEROS              TO  PO-COMPARE-PERCENT.

           IF MPLTINFO-REQ-PRINT-MANUF-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "Y"                TO  REQ-PRINT-MANUF-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "N"                TO  REQ-PRINT-MANUF-SW.

           IF MPLTINFO-ADDTL-DATA-EDIT-SW = "N"
               MOVE "N"                TO  ADDTL-DATA-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "Y"                TO  ADDTL-DATA-SW.

      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00"     TO  FILE-STATUS.

       64-SCREEN4.
           MOVE "USEROPT4"             TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO  USER-OPTION-SCREEN4.
           PERFORM 641-READ-MPLTINFO.

       64-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE USER-OPTION-SCREEN4    TO  DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC            TO  USER-OPTION-SCREEN4.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 64-SCREEN4-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9                TO  LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10                TO  LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER     TO  S2-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"               TO  IND(99)
               GO TO 64-SHOW-FORM.

       64-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
9210CK     MOVE "PREG"                 TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
  .        PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
  .        IF DISCOUNT-TAX-SW = "B"
  .            MOVE "N"                TO MPLTINFO-DISCOUNT-TAX-SW
  .        ELSE
  .            MOVE "Y"                TO MPLTINFO-DISCOUNT-TAX-SW.
9210CK     PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

9210CK     MOVE "PODL"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
9210CK     PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
9210CK     ADD 2 TO LAST-ABST GIVING MPLTINFO-INV-LAST-ABST.
9305JC     MOVE ACTIVE-NWO-SW          TO  MPLTINFO-NWACTIVE-SW.
           MOVE NUM-MONTHS             TO  MPLTINFO-SREL-DEL-MTH.
9210CK     PERFORM 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.

       64-SCREEN4-X.
           EXIT.

       641-READ-MPLTINFO.
9210CK     MOVE "PREG"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
  .        PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
  .        IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
  .           MOVE "MPLTINFO PREG NOT FOUND*631-RM" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
9210CK        PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
9301CK     IF MPLTINFO-DISCOUNT-TAX-SW = "Y"
  .            MOVE "A"                TO  DISCOUNT-TAX-SW
  .        ELSE
9301CK         MOVE "B"                TO  DISCOUNT-TAX-SW.

9210CK     MOVE "PODL"                 TO  MPLTINFO-ARG.
  .        PERFORM 9-READ-MPLTINFO.
  .        IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
  .            MOVE SPACES             TO BUF-MPLTINFO
  .            MOVE "PODL"             TO MPLTINFO-KEY
  .            MOVE 2                  TO MPLTINFO-INV-LAST-ABST
  .            PERFORM 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO.
  .
  .        IF MPLTINFO-INV-LAST-ABST IS NUMERIC
  .           SUBTRACT 2 FROM MPLTINFO-INV-LAST-ABST GIVING LAST-ABST
  .        ELSE
9210CK        MOVE 0 TO LAST-ABST.

           IF MPLTINFO-NWACTIVE-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "Y"                TO ACTIVE-NWO-SW
           ELSE
           MOVE "N"                    TO ACTIVE-NWO-SW.

      *------ NUMBER OF MONTHS TO KEEP SHIPPING RELEASE AUDIT DATA.
      *------ IF THE FIELD DOESN'T EXIST, DEFAULT TO 6 MONTHS.
           IF MPLTINFO-SREL-DEL-MTH NUMERIC AND
                  MPLTINFO-SREL-DEL-MTH NOT = ZERO
               MOVE MPLTINFO-SREL-DEL-MTH  TO NUM-MONTHS
           ELSE
               MOVE 06                     TO NUM-MONTHS.

      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00"     TO  FILE-STATUS.

      ***************************************************************
      **                                                           **
      **          P E R F O R M E D    R O U T I N E S             **
      **                                                           **
      ***************************************************************

       9-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE 0                      TO  COND-WORD.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 9-READ-MPLTINFO"
                                       TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG       TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       9-WRITE-MPLTINFO.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "WRT MPLTINFO ERROR IN 9-WRITE-MPLTINFO"
                                       TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE MPLTINFO-KEY       TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO.
           REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "REWRITE  ERROR IN 9-REWRITE-MPLTINFO"
                                       TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE MPLTINFO-KEY       TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.

       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM        TO  CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM        TO  CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT       TO  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
